    rectangle "==Web Application\n<size:16>[Container: HTML/CSS/JavaScript modules]</size>\n\nThe presentation layer (index.html, style.css, src/game/). Owns the DOM, the canvas, input, audio, HUD and sheets, and localStorage. Reads state from the Simulation Core every frame and changes it only through the Core's exports." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as Production.Browser.Browsertab.WebApplication_1
    rectangle "==Wiki\n<size:16>[Container: HTML/CSS/JavaScript modules]</size>\n\nThe player documentation (wiki/), served next to the game. The game teaches nothing in-game, so every mechanic is written up here; tables and figures are rendered at load time from the Simulation Core's content and tuning, so they can never drift from the game. An Ideas page (ideas.js) collects possible directions for the game, clearly marked as not in it. Everything in the game is listed from the Catalog with its default pictures, and the texture pack format is documented." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as Production.Browser.Browsertab.Wiki_1
    rectangle "==Default Texture Pack\n<size:16>[Container: JSON + SVG]</size>\n\nLanternlight (packs/default/): pack.json mapping every thing in the Catalog to its SVG pictures and colours. Required before the game draws anything; players' packs override any part of it." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as Production.Browser.Browsertab.DefaultTexturePack_1
